    "introduction": "Dade (Davide Pavanello, 1977) is a film composer, multi-platinum music producer, founder of INRI, member of Linea 77, and bassist for Italian rapper Salmo. In 2023, he co-composed the soundtrack for Gloria! with Margherita Vicario, which won the David di Donatello, Nastro d’Argento, and Globo d’Oro awards. He subsequently composed the scores for Io e il Secco, STRIKE – Figli di un’era sbagliata, and the Netflix series Il capo perfetto. He is also one of the founders of Ezechiele 25:17, the only agency in Italy dedicated to representing film composers.",
